.TH COGTRIX-API 5 "2026-03-30" "cogtrix 1.0.0" "Cogtrix Manual"
.SH NAME
cogtrix-api \- API server configuration
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Cogtrix REST API server is configured via environment variables and
the shared
.B .cogtrix.json
file. See
.BR cogtrix (5)
for the config file format.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
Required. Anthropic API key.
.TP
.B DATABASE_URL
PostgreSQL connection string (e.g. \(lqpostgresql://user:pass@localhost/cogtrix\(rq).
.TP
.B REDIS_URL
Redis connection string for session presence. Default: \(lqredis://localhost:6379\(rq.
.TP
.B SECRET_KEY
JWT signing secret. Must be set in production.
.TP
.B COGTRIX_ENV
Deployment environment: \(lqdevelopment\(rq or \(lqproduction\(rq.
.TP
.B COGTRIX_LOG_LEVEL
Logging level: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR. Default: INFO.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cogtrix-api (1),
.BR cogtrix-api (8),
.BR cogtrix (5)
